; A pad that pads nothing is an error, as in beancount: one whose next assertion
; holds already, one no assertion follows, and one replaced by a later pad of its
; account before any assertion.
option "operating_currency" "CNY"

1970-01-01 commodity CNY
1970-01-01 open Assets:A
1970-01-01 open Assets:B
1970-01-01 open Assets:C
1970-01-01 open Equity:Open

2024-01-01 * "x" "opening"
  Assets:A  10 CNY
  Equity:Open

2024-01-02 pad Assets:A Equity:Open
2024-01-02 pad Assets:B Equity:Open
2024-01-02 pad Assets:C Equity:Open
2024-01-03 pad Assets:C Equity:Open

2024-01-04 balance Assets:A  10 CNY
2024-01-04 balance Assets:C  5 CNY
